==Event Information==
The fragile giant sunfish Mola Mola returns to the Cat Army for one more adventure... Login today and check out the new "Survive! Mola Mola!" collab in The Battle Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from February 10th (11am) thru 24th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●"Survive! Mola Mola!" Limited Capsule Set!'''}}<br>
Only now, visit the Rare Capsule Machine and tap the "Survive! Mola Mola!" tab at the top of the menu to draw for a special set including Mola Mola! units available only from this collaboration event! This set includes:

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Collab Units!'''}}<br>
[[Mola King (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''King Mola (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
No enemy can withstand the area attack of his piercing cry! Stun baddies into submission from a safe distance!<br>
[[Baby Mola (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Baby Mola (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A living miracle, the only survivor of a family of millions! Suffers from low HP, but is a fierce long-distance attacker when protected by high-defense Cats!

<small><small>※Please note that draws from the Survive! Mola Mola! rare capsule set may provide regularly appearing rare Cat units. "Survive! Mola Mola!" collab units will not be available from other scheduled Rare Capsule sets appearing during the collaboration.<br>
※If "Survive! Mola Mola!" content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Limited Collab Stages in The Battle Cats app!'''}}<br>
The return of "Survive! Mola Mola!" collab stages, along with a brand new challenge! Fight fishy foes from the Mola Mola universe and earn awesome rewards!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Collab Map "Survive! Mola Mola!" Returns!'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stories during this campaign, tap "Battle", and select the {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Survive! Mola Mola!'''}} Map to begin the challenge!<br>
Clearing any stage in this map will give a small chance to pick up the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Limited Collab Unit'''}} {{Color|#FF0000|'''"'''}}[[Meowla Meowla (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Meowla Meowla'''}}]]{{Color|#FF0000|'''"'''}} as a reward!<br>
Later, more difficult stages in the map will give a higher chance to collect Meowla Meowla as a clear reward!<br>
(Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to collect stage clear rewards!)<br>
<small><small>※ Meowla Meowla cannot be collected again if already picked up from a previous Survive! Mola Mola! event.<br>
※ Meowla Meowla can be activated at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu after being collected as a stage reward.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Collab Map: "300 Million Dead Molas"'''}}<br>
In these Timed Score stages, you will earn bigger and better rewards the higher your final score result! Clear the stage faster to earn a better score and get the best prizes!<br>
<small><small>※ Tap the Timed Score button on the "300 Million Dead Molas" map screen to view all possible score rewards.<br>
※ If the collab stages do not appear, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Special Catclaw Dojo Stage: "Aqua Paradiso"'''}}<br>
Visit the Catclaw Dojo's special collab event {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Aqua Paradiso'''}} and pit your score against a world of the Battle Cats fans as you race to the top of the leaderboards!<br>
Can you defeat enough Molas within the time limit to rank in the top 1% of players?
Clear the stage, get a high score and earn rewards based on your score tier at the end of this collab-only Dojo challenge!<br>
<small><small>※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a play ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Survive! Mola Mola stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!<br>
<small><small>※These Special missions can only be completed until February 24th at 11:00am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Login daily to earn items and a Rare Ticket!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base menu during this campaign, you will pick up another login stamp! More login stamps will get you bigger and better prizes, including a Rare Ticket!<br>
<small><small>※Up to 14 Stamps can be earned during this event.</small></small>

